    "created_at": "2025-04-07T11:41:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-07T11:41:11Z",
    "body": "I'm very surprised to see the `code` element wrapping the `pre` element instead of the other way around. Apart from that this sounds like a nice idea, that is perhaps best addressed through some CSS extension (that we then standardize markup for, such as a `dedent` attribute)\n\ncc @whatwg/css",
